bgQdG3CsQ&oe=6B0DB69B"}, "display_name": "Arena240", "keywords": ["pvp", "240hz", "ffa", "combat", "bots"], "long_description": "A 12 player free-for-all PvP arena built to run at 240hz on Quest3 (or 207hz if you aren't able to developer mode your headset to push it to 240!)\n\nNOTE: This is an EXPERIMENTAL game testing the capabilities of the Quest3 it is UNFINISHED and NOT COMPLETE. \n\n- 12 Weapon pickups around the arena\n- Bots keep lobbies active\n- Joystick locomotion(you can swap/disable in settings)\n- Everything grabbable/climbable\n- Some weapons have movement tech.\n- Earn crowns for highest damage, eliminations, and health pickups.\n\nCONTROLS:\n\nJoysticks - Move/Jump/Crouch\nA/X - Dash\nB/Y - Drop Item\nTrigger - Fire Weapon/Use Item\nGrip - Grab/Climb\nJoystick Click - Push-to-talk\nMenu Button - Open Scoreboard/Menu\n(You can also grab one hand with the other and pull to open the menu)\n\nBuilt by the makers of DUST\n\njoin the DUST discord if you have suggestions/bug reports: discord.gg/dustvr", "short_description": "12 player Free-for-all VR PvP at 240hz! (207hz technically) Bots keep lobbies active. Joystick locomotion. \n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://vrdojo.games/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRdojo", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/dustvr", "website_url": "https://vrdojo.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["